# The built standalone HTML (AshenSpire.html, AshenSpire-mobile.html and their
# build/ and dist/ twins) is no longer tracked on dev: CI builds it on every push
# and publishes it as a workflow artifact (.github/workflows/dev-preview.yml), and
# .gitignore keeps it out of commits. The Git LFS rules that used to live here
# uploaded ~284 MB of new LFS objects per rebuild and exhausted the repository's
# LFS budget; they were removed with the files. release/ and main keep their own
# copies of this file until the owner promotes this change.
# Original engraved UI bytes are shared by high/light exports on every OS.
assets/player-polish/**/*.svg text eol=lf
assets-mobile/player-polish/**/*.svg text eol=lf
